<h2>CTA01</h2>

<p>Standalone Call-to-Action button. Instead of using a button inside each text element (TIC01, TIC02, TIC03),
    a CTA can be placed below all elements (representing all of them).</p>

<p><strong>Possible placement:</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li>Content zone</li>
    <li>Margin column</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Options:</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li>Button color</li>
    <li>Alignment</li>
    <li>Title-Attribute (optional)</li>
</ul>

<div class="pl-c-text-passage">
    <p><strong>CSS-Classes:</strong></p>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Element</th>
                <th>Description</th>
                <th>CSS-Class</th>
                <th>Default value</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>[data-tpl="cta01"]</td>
                <td>Button alignment</td>
                <td><code>cta01--center</code> <code>cta01--right</code></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>[data-tpl="cta01"] &lt;a&gt;</td>
                <td>Button color</td>
                <td><code>color-cta--gradient-green-reverse</code> <code>color-cta--blue</code>
                    <code>color-cta-2</code> <code>color-cta--gradient-green</code>
                </td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

</div>